.dart_tool/
build/
*.dill
*.snapshot

# The engine checkout. Pinned in versions.json; the port is commits on the
# forks it names (docs/engine.md). Large, and checked out by tooling.
third_party/

# Everything the tools write: packaged engines, crash dumps, suite results,
# shader probes, screenshots, and the per-console record of what has already
# been pushed. All of it is regenerated, and most of it describes one console.
out/

